## RelationType: categorizes

Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/categorizes`. Source definition: relation between classifiers in which a higher-order classifier classifies a lower-order classifier and designates a set that has as members only sets designated by lower-order classifiers that it organizes. This BKN projection stores the target entity ID in `categorizes_target_id`.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| classifier | classifier | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| categorizes_target_id | entity_id |
